In an extreme feat of agility, you move to a spot you can see within range, bounding around, over, or through any enemies in the way.

This talent cannot be used while wearing heavy armor, and leaves you exhausted.  The exhaustion increases the cost of your activated Mobility talents by [81%, 64%, 55%, 48%, 44% (TL1-5)] (stacking), but fades over [27, 23, 20, 19, 17 (TL1-5)] turns.
